window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>As one of New York's top sex therapists, Dr. Morgan Snow sees everything from the abused to the depraved. From high-profile clients with twisted obsessions to courageous survivors, the Butterfield Institute is the sanctuary to heal battered souls. </p><p>Morgan Snow's newest patient is a powerful, influential man - secretly addicted to watching Internet Web cam pornography. He's not alone in his desires. She's also working with a group of high school teenagers equally and dangerously obsessed with these real-time fantasies - fantasies that are all too accessible. </p><p>Then the woman start dying online, right in front of their eyes. Now it's all about murder. </p>"; 
